'''Noxifer seeds''' are dropped by certain monsters found in the [[Chambers of Xeric]]. It can also be found at the end of a floor by raking the [[weeds (Chambers of Xeric)|weeds]] near the [[hole (Chambers of Xeric)|entrance]] to the next level.

It can be planted in a resource room in the Chambers to grow [[noxifer]].

